<title>USA: Tollgrade board oks share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Tollgrade board oks share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHESWICK, Pa 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tollgrade Communications said Tuesday that its board had authorized a repurchase of up to 200,000 shares of its common stock during the next two years.</p>
<p>The company said the shares will be used to provide stock under employee stock-option programs.</p>
<p>It said it would use existing cash and short-term investments to finance the repurchases.</p>
</text>
